   Ramirez-Olivares, Edison Raul; Olivares-Espinoza, Jose Vladimir; Segovia-Pasten, Diego Ignacio; Alfaro-Robles, Juan Sebastian, Univ Serena, Dept Ingn Minas, La Serena 1720170, Chile.},
